{"duration":36.892,"segments":[{"text":"Sure. The aura splits your voice into six frequency bands, from the low hum of vowels up to the hiss of an s.","start":0.1,"end":6.165,"marks":[[0,5,0.1],[6,3,0.719],[10,4,0.878],[15,6,1.128],[22,4,1.527],[27,5,1.637],[33,4,1.966],[38,3,2.175],[42,9,2.495],[52,6,3.098],[59,4,3.812],[64,3,4.001],[68,3,4.091],[72,3,4.29],[76,2,4.51],[79,6,4.61],[86,2,5.019],[89,2,5.178],[92,3,5.278],[96,4,5.398],[101,2,5.647],[104,2,5.747],[107,2,5.857]]},{"text":"Each band has its own color. When you are silent, all six sit on top of each other and add up to white. When you speak, each band rises with its own energy, so the colors pull apart. Where two bands still overlap, their colors mix, like light through a prism.","start":6.665,"end":17.259,"marks":[[0,4,6.665],[5,4,6.894],[10,3,7.143],[14,3,7.353],[18,3,7.553],[22,6,7.752],[29,4,8.386],[34,3,8.605],[38,3,8.765],[42,7,8.884],[50,3,9.658],[54,3,9.847],[58,3,10.147],[62,2,10.306],[65,3,10.486],[69,2,10.775],[72,4,10.895],[77,5,11.084],[83,3,11.334],[87,3,11.474],[91,2,11.643],[94,2,11.803],[97,6,11.903],[104,4,12.491],[109,3,12.711],[113,6,12.85],[120,4,13.569],[125,4,13.778],[130,5,14.048],[136,4,14.477],[141,3,14.646],[145,3,14.846],[149,7,15.026],[157,2,15.729],[160,3,15.968],[164,6,16.078],[171,4,16.497],[176,6,16.757]]},{"text":"The table lists the six bands, from red for the lowest tones up to violet for the highest.","start":17.759,"end":22.495,"marks":[[0,3,17.759],[4,5,17.879],[10,5,18.288],[16,3,18.607],[20,3,18.707],[24,6,19.027],[31,4,19.74],[36,3,19.949],[40,3,20.139],[44,3,20.279],[48,6,20.398],[55,5,20.768],[61,2,21.107],[64,2,21.266],[67,6,21.366],[74,3,21.765],[78,3,21.895],[82,8,22.015]]},{"text":"The code attaches the aura to the message box and feeds it your microphone.","start":22.995,"end":26.906,"marks":[[0,3,22.995],[4,4,23.114],[9,8,23.414],[18,3,23.972],[22,4,24.122],[27,2,24.372],[30,3,24.511],[34,7,24.611],[42,3,25.03],[46,3,25.349],[50,5,25.479],[56,2,25.818],[59,4,25.978],[64,11,26.088]]},{"text":"The picture shows all six bands stacking into a single white line.","start":27.406,"end":31.057,"marks":[[0,3,27.406],[4,7,27.526],[12,5,27.945],[18,3,28.304],[22,3,28.484],[26,5,28.813],[32,8,29.152],[41,4,29.611],[46,1,29.881],[48,6,29.95],[55,5,30.369],[61,5,30.649]]},{"text":"Vowels light up the warm colors. Sounds like s and sh push the blue and violet bands.","start":31.557,"end":36.592,"marks":[[0,6,31.557],[7,5,31.996],[13,2,32.226],[16,3,32.395],[20,4,32.495],[25,7,32.794],[33,6,33.553],[40,4,33.982],[45,1,34.221],[47,3,34.411],[51,2,34.55],[54,4,35.009],[59,3,35.269],[63,4,35.369],[68,3,35.603],[72,6,35.733],[79,6,36.132]]}]}